 ia. The hamlet of Yolo is just a short six-mile drive up Interstate 5. Bri
 ng your picnic dinner and a lawn chair if you'd like to stay for a social 
 hour at 7:00. Orientation for newcomers will be included. This event is no
 t sponsored by Yolo County Library and the presence of Indivisible Yo
